            <ArticleTitle>Little league shoulder syndrome in an adolescent cricket player.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E14</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The first case of little league shoulder syndrome in a cricket player is reported. The condition has been reported in baseball pitchers and is characterised by a proximal humeral epiphyseolysis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
